  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "FEEL AT HOME IN OUR DENTAL OFFICE",
   "section": 9
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "For your convenience, we offer flexible hours for scheduling your appointments. If you have a dental emergency outside of our operating hours, please call as soon as possible to schedule follow-up care. We will ensure you receive the dental treatment you need in a timely manner. For more information, visit our Contact page.",
   "html": "<p>For your convenience, we offer flexible hours for scheduling your appointments. If you have a dental emergency outside of our operating hours, please call as soon as possible to schedule follow-up care. We will ensure you receive the dental treatment you need in a timely manner. For more information, visit our Contact page.</p>",
   "section": 9
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 1,
   "text": "MEET DR. TAM NGUYEN",
   "section": 10
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "src": "/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/mam.png",
   "alt": "TAM NGUYEN",
   "w": null,
   "h": null,
   "srcset": [],
   "section": 11
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Dr. Nguyen is proud to call Houston her home. She was born and raised in southwest Houston, where she attended DeBakey High School for Health Professions and graduated with a Bachelor’s degree from the University of Texas at Austin (Hook’em Horns!). She obtained her dental degree from Boston University in Boston, MA where she also met her husband, William.",
   "html": "<p>Dr. Nguyen is proud to call Houston her home. She was born and raised in southwest Houston, where she attended DeBakey High School for Health Professions and graduated with a Bachelor’s degree from the University of Texas at Austin (Hook’em Horns!). She obtained her dental degree from Boston University in Boston, MA where she also met her husband, William.</p>",
   "section": 11
  },
