  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "My 3 year old daughter recently saw Dr. Nguyen and I was so concerned my daughter would not do well. I was wrong!! Dr. Nguyen was so kind, calm, and patient that my daughter was put at ease. Dr. Nguyen explained what she would be doing beforehand and my daughter enjoyed her appointment so much that has been asking to go to the dentist. Thank you Dr. Nguyen!",
   "html": "<p>My 3 year old daughter recently saw Dr. Nguyen and I was so concerned my daughter would not do well. I was wrong!! Dr. Nguyen was so kind, calm, and patient that my daughter was put at ease. Dr. Nguyen explained what she would be doing beforehand and my daughter enjoyed her appointment so much that has been asking to go to the dentist. Thank you Dr. Nguyen!</p>",
