  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Dr. Nguyen was fantastic with my twin boys. She was very patient and put them at ease. The location was also easy to find and so was scheduling their appointments.",
   "html": "<p>Dr. Nguyen was fantastic with my twin boys. She was very patient and put them at ease. The location was also easy to find and so was scheduling their appointments.</p>",
