   "text": "Laraine Nebrida",
   "section": 16
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Amazing sweet staff …. Love Tiffany she is amazing .. Doctor is amazing as well",
   "html": "<p>Amazing sweet staff …. Love Tiffany she is amazing .. Doctor is amazing as well</p>",
   "section": 16
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "jennifer espinoza",
   "section": 16
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "I am a former patient of this clinic. As a child I was never fond of the idea that my mom couldn’t come to the back with me until the actual dentist showed up. I also have severe sensory issues that result in me having difficulty taking dental X-rays. The staff was never particularly understanding of this issue and the fact that I cannot open my mouth very wide due to a small jaw. They actually used a tool to prop my mouth open even though it literally popped my jaw out! I’ve long since found a new dental home and will never set foot here again!",
   "html": "<p>I am a former patient of this clinic. As a child I was never fond of the idea that my mom couldn’t come to the back with me until the actual dentist showed up. I also have severe sensory issues that result in me having difficulty taking dental X-rays. The staff was never particularly understanding of this issue and the fact that I cannot open my mouth very wide due to a small jaw. They actually used a tool to prop my mouth open even though it literally popped my jaw out! I’ve long since found a new dental home and will never set foot here again!</p>",
   "section": 16
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Allyson Padilla",
   "section": 16
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Dr. Nguyen was great with my two boys! The staff was patient and we can’t wait to come back for our next check up!",
   "html": "<p>Dr. Nguyen was great with my two boys! The staff was patient and we can’t wait to come back for our next check up!</p>",
   "section": 16
